{"id":"9b811b33e8dc","path":"/it/universita/info/servizio-ricerca/funding-opportunities/postdocs","lang":"it","title":"Research support","description":"This section of the website is dedicated to Research Support and provides USI researchers with: Information on all open calls for research projects and information events; Specific information on each funding programme for PhD students, postdocs and experienced researchers…","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","Research Service"],"image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/servizio-ricerca-hp.jpg?itok=hs3nrMM5","words":151,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/servizio-ricerca","en":"/en/university/info/research-service"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"Research Service","path":"/en/university/info/research-service"},{"label":"Research support","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>This section of the website is dedicated to Research Support and provides USI researchers with:</p> <ul> <li>Information on all open calls for research projects and information events;</li> <li>Specific information on each funding programme for PhD students, postdocs and experienced researchers;</li> <li>Support for the preparation of applications;</li> <li>Support and advice to write a Data Management Plan;</li> <li>Research project administration;</li> </ul> <p>This information and support is provided by the Research Service of USI (Università della Svizzera italiana), whose mission is to support USI researchers in their scientific activities.</p> <p>The service hosts the regional <a href=\"https://www.euresearch.ch/\">Euresearch office</a>, a non-profit organisation funded by the State Secretariat for Education, Research and Innovation (SERI) which promotes and facilitates the participation of researchers, organisations and companies in European R&amp;I projects and programmes.</p> <p><strong>Interview by Euresearch:</strong><br><br> <em>Nice To Meet You – Sara Caspani, Head of the Euresearch Office and Grants Advisor at USI</em><br><br> <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/nice-meet-you-sara-caspani-euresearch-cpkve/\">Read more</a></p> <p><a href=\"/en/originalnode/8526\">Research USI in facts and figures</a></p>"},{"t":"image","src":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/servizio-ricerca-hp.jpg?itok=hs3nrMM5","alt":"servizio-ricerca-hp.jpg"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Research support","href":"/en/university/info/research-service"},{"label":"Open Calls","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/current-opportunities/open-calls"},{"label":"Rolling Calls","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/current-opportunities/rolling-calls"},{"label":"Events","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/current-opportunities/events"},{"label":"News","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/current-opportunities/news"},{"label":"Newsletter","href":"https://newsletter.usi.ch/ns_published/en/110"},{"label":"Competitive Foundations","href":"/en/university/info/research-servicet/funding-opportunities/competitive-foundations"},{"label":"Fondo Istituzionale per la Ricerca (FIR)","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/funding-opportunities/fondo-istituzionale-ricerca"},{"label":"Call for projects on Open Science and Open Research Data","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/funding-opportunities/call-projects-open-science-open-research-data"},{"label":"For PhD students","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/funding-opportunities/phd-students"},{"label":"For Postdocs","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/funding-opportunities/postdocs"},{"label":"For experienced researchers","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/funding-opportunities/experienced-researchers"},{"label":"For companies","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/fundi